  "resolution_html": "<p>Using the <strong>Web Interface</strong> (i.e. Web browser):</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <a href=\"http://listserv.yorku.ca/\">http://listserv.yorku.ca</a></li>\n<li>Open List Management and select List Configuration</li>\n<li>Select list from drop down menu</li>\n<li>Click Subscriptions</li>\n<li>In the box beside Daily-Threshold= enter the number of messages (default is 100) and click update</li>\n</ol>",
